rInfo(1777811); return false;">weizhong</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lazar-lyusternik" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2326669); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2326669&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1484774226" alt="Lazar Lyusternik" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2326669)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lazar-lyusternik" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2326669); return false;">Lazar Lyusternik</a></span> for reviewing this. Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/accelerando" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1599414); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1599414&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1484774226" alt="Accelerando" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1599414)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/accelerando" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1599414); return false;">Accelerando</a></span> for their helping me with Wikidot syntax issues, to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2303803); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2303803&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1484774226" alt="Cyantreuse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2303803)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2303803); return false;">Cyantreuse</a></span> for giving me Photoshop advice for the Two Nixons picture and answering my questions about image licensing, and to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;"><img class=