<p>I am indebted to you all. :)</p>
<p>I credit <a href="http://futurama.wikia.com/wiki/Richard_M._Nixon's_head">Futurama</a> for sparking my enduring fascination with all things Nixon.</p>
<p><strong>Image Attribution:</strong> All images are public domain except for <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Man_in_orange_jumpsuit_working_on_fence_at_Summer_Palace,_Beijing.jpg">this one</a>, released by Daniel Case under the Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 Unported license, and <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cinder_block_wall_background.jpg">this one</a>, released by Techclasslit under the Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 4.0 International license. All images were modified by me.</p>
<p><strong>Historical Context:</strong> This is based on the life and presidency of <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_Nixon">Richard M. Nixon</a> (obviously), as well as on the numerous conspiracy theories that have originated around <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bohemian_Grove">Bohemian Grove</a>, which Nixon was <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bohemian_Grove#/media/File:Harvey_Hancock_at_Bohemian_Grove_1967.jpeg">known to attend</a> (and look, he brought a friend&#8230;).</p>

