<p>the final picture, which seems to exist only so you can link to 1981.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The 1981 reference is <em>definitely</em> not meant to feel shoehorned - there are actually several references to 1981 throughout the text before that point, but they might simply not be clear/obvious enough. I'll see what I can do about that. My intent in linking 1981 was to suggest that the same forces that tormented Reagan at the end of his life are the ones tormenting Nixon at the end of his (and those forces are what put both those men in power).</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Otherwise, this is a really great skip, especially for a first!</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Thanks, I really appreciate that! :)</p>

